{\LARGE\bfseries The Evolving Text}\\[0.3em]
{\large\itshape Time, coherence, rupture, return}\\[1em]
{\sffamily\small Iman Poernomo, with Cassie, Darja \& Nahla --- Meson Press, 2026}
